Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, is waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld. Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our moths will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams, and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what that shrimp did to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He just took down Spartan\Nlike it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was one of the star\Ncontenders of the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Klutz just tripped over himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't lodge you in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you start a fight before the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you're\Ngoing to have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need trash like you\Ncausing brawls before the man's -
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The big guy started a\Nfight he couldn't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one you should disqualify\Nif he weren't unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't believe it—that's\NCyan Boo from Kano,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's not Chin Down behind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't mention it, Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,pipsqueak
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it kind of pisses me off when\NI hear anyone say the words thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take back the credits,\Nyou grateful bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to reject\Nit that hard, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever say those words\Nto me again, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it gets a little worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that there's all\Ntypes out there. Dogama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to know it's pointless making
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,alliances with the other\Nbig shots in your block!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is a baseless\Naccusation, Kelly Funk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough trash talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lot of big names showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like each country chose\Nto send their baddest dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for a fight\Nbetween gladiators,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is turning into a\Nwar between nations over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First conspiracy and now bribery!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me sick, Dagama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in lying with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you cheat like that,\Nthere's only one winner per block.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That means someone's gotta go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we cut the crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here on your\Ncountry's orders, same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame flame fruit\Ngives you more than power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives you prestige.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most importantly, it gives you\Na tactical military advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around at\Nthe faces in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Suleyman, the beheader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Class A war criminal involved\Nin the Sea Battle of Diaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Abdullah and Jeet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Former bounty hunters now wanted for their\Nsavage attacks of government buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about our Lumbus, the\Nsurmounter, the adventurer of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sponsored by the Don\NQuixote family itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the sadistic hundred\Nmillion pirate, Bellamy the Hyena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I also heard the pirate noble\NCavendish is gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And the mad rookie Bartolomeo who\Nmade waves in the new world last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You think with this room\Nof notorious characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,no one is plotting to rig the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be insane if we didn't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you two are up\Nto something as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The first challenge\Nhere is a free-for-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one winner per block\Ngoes to the next round. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Block A's match is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then B, C, and D will get their turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a grand total\Nof 550 competitors here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the following round,\Nonly four will move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds of winning are pretty slim,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but having your brother in the\Nsame block should certainly help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's merely a coincidence and not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,because you paid an\Nofficial to arrange it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lucky, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Which block do I find in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The receptionist should\Nhave told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It says here that you're in block C.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone here has got a\Ndifferent reason to fight and depending
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,on whoever gets the flame flame fruit\NThe whole world could fall into chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's the way it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck and may the best man win
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,armor helmets and swords.\NMy head's about to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,explode you mean we can\Nuse whatever we want choose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,anything except projectile weapons a half
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-naked statue of an ancient\Nwarrior dude Kick ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna wear this armor and\Nhelmet cooler than that old man's!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, and this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Usopp and the\Nothers could see me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nobleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A nobleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the female staff are wilting\Nlike daisies! What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a peek is too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the pirate noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Degrading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice ensemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, there is a weight\Nlimit for gear, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All the weapons and armor\Nin the world won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one who deserves the Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Such beautiful power is wasted on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only fit for someone\Nequally as stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're over the weight limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I look so cool like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why everyone's\Nrunning around half-naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladiators are nothing more\Nthan a delivery system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blood of the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what they thirst for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This coliseum, it extracts the truth, strips\Nman down to his most authentic nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't want a protracted\Nmatch between sword and armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This competition's more\Nthan just a show for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a release.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to take off the cape, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so awesome on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:08:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Watched you crush that giant brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Made me wonder who you are. Me? Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It says your name's Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn how to enunciate\Nbetter, you damn dolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost crapped myself\Nthinking Straw Hat was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that little shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the real Luffy's\Nover 20 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,His shield is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky thing you're not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you were the real Straw Hat\NLuffy, I wouldn't wait for the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd kill you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three years since I\Nfirst arrived in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire globe was\Nentranced by the story of the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful rookie with a 200\Nmillion bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the front page news every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:10:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Young women went nuts over my wanted\Nposters, and they became a collector's item.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They ripped them from\Nthe walls of every town
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so they could hang them in their bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The world fell head over\Nheels in love with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's the shining\Nstar who you mean—me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who else but then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A single freaking year later,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,all anyone wanted to talk about\Nwas the stupid war in Marine Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard stole the spotlight from me,\Nand Straw Hat Luffy stepped into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right next to him, and on top of that,\Na deluge of new rookies kept pouring in,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,earning themselves the mantle of the worst\Ngeneration, and abducting the public's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The journalists practically forgot that\NI even existed, and that's why I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,These unworthy usurpers, they will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you got other\Nproblems to work on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To recapture the public adoration\NI deserve, I will do anything it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,takes and kill every rookie there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The first step is winning\Ntoday's prize, the flame flame
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're qualified. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever ignore me\Nagain after I have won this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You competing, dollface?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't gonna last,\Nbut you sure are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you really don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's kinda funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wound up wearing the same\Nfighting costume as this old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you interested in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rebecca, a gladiator here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a fool of Spartan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that guy. Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This statue before you,\Nthis man was a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the greatest gladiator in the\Nwhole history of the Corrida Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought 3 ,000 matches and\Nclaimed 3 ,000 victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The only wound he ever suffered\Nin combat was a single slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:11:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was still fighting here\Nuntil just 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, he is unknown to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one remembers a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the elders, or\Neven the gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No one recalls having met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most mysterious\Nstatue in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He might not have existed for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone could have just made him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, who knows how\Nlong this statue has been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All that we really know of the man is what\Nsomeone engraved on this placard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we don't know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to remove the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Another mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, yeah, that's some pretty weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta admit, it does look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And super manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Rebecca\Nthe Great Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can keep that\Nwin record going out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're happy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,About Spartan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bully really got his\Nass kicked, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, knock it off,\Nyou idiots. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay them no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Today will be my final battle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take the Devil Fruit\Nprize for my own, and end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What block are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,C. That's good. I'm in D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cross my fingers for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we both survive the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we have a champion of blockade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The masked man takes it all, Mr. Starr!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He ended the fight in a mere moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, it looks as though the mystery\Nman is about to remove his mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The mask is off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems our mystery man is a fighter\Nfamous across the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a stunning opening\Nand an unexpected victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the Block\NA Battle Royale is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The first division captain serving under\Nthe fearsome warlord Emperor Blackbeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus Burgess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That champion got us all the way back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Blackbeard Pirates are in the mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just expected Luffy to win\Nthis tournament pretty easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but now, well, that might not be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping he doesn't\Nreveal himself somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got a job, so... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast! Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it, you damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know where I can find the\Nfactory, then you're worthless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find a high-ranking\Nbig shot in the Don
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quixote family and beat the location\Nout of it. So you... Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't voice such radical\Nviews in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Hyruden, the pirate mercenary, and\NCavendish, and Gambia, the missionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what the big rush is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a pretty bad batch, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be big trouble if one of\Nthese guys wins the Flame Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to Esho right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What you doing, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't communicating with someone\Non the outside, are you, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that would be fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And hey, what's that\Nyou're writing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you whispering out the\Nnames of the hottest pirates around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a guess here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not with the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me ten and I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Coliseum is still thundering\Nfrom the excitement of blockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hope you bring the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to make an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of familiar\Nnames to sound you long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's our next plan of action, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As a measure of safety, we should send\Nfor no less than three Navy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meanwhile, you and I, we'll\Nhead for, uh, what was it called again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean Greenbit? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make our way there, and let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need, well, call for as\Nmany medics as you possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a chance of civilian injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On the side of intel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a head count of all\Nthe people in the stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and the exact population of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you want this instead\Nof the enemy numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the number to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We should only be concerned with the\Nnumber of lives we need to protect first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayna calling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for disconnecting earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a name I mentioned, Gumby of the\NMissionary, the one working for Bartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and cross his name off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is still on track, so\NI'm going to keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to green bit huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can, but I sure wouldn't recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:19:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Researchers, explorers—what\Nwe're, uh, little of both,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever you want—is it\Nworth risking your life over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it better be the bridge there—what\Nis it made of? It looks unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks unusual
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's solid iron, but that\Ndoesn't make it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's obvious enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, nobody's\Nbrave enough to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a school of fighting fish nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas around Green Bit\Nare full of the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Before those monsters moved in,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,people used to go to and\Nfrom Green Bit all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was about 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,These fish, what are they like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty horns, nasty disposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,take a ship and they'll\Ncapsize you oh and they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,attack the bridge too that's\Nwhat all those iron bars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,are for although I hear\Nthat barely slows them down
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a sec they're fish\Nwhat do they fly out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,water and tear straight\Nthrough solid iron maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,brave enough to see myself\NI know plenty of people
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who've tried to go but I\Ndon't know anyone who's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,come back what traffic what\Ngives why'd you pick such
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a dangerous spot for\Nthe trade-off no kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,can't you hand me over\Nsomeplace nice you fool yeah no
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,point in complaining we're\Nalready here more importantly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think the\Npeople in this country are
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,acting kind of strange the\Nflamingo said he stepped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,down if they don't have a\Nking why is everybody so
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,calm we were taken by surprise\Nthe moment we got here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what worries me hey\NRobin is something wrong or
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to know those weirdos?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,CP-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,CP?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest intelligence\Nagents in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypher-Pull, Aegis-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,CP-9?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.35,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me they're not that tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that they're\Nmuch more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think they're here\Nbecause of my stone, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever their objective may be, if\Nthey're here, it can't be good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now, fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking my sword back, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Owie, ow, ow! Dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I really messed up, and\Nhuman's gonna see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for hostility!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just an old man passing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, what's with\Nthat topknot under your hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's simply a topknot-shaped hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw you in the video Caesar\Nwas broadcasting from Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You samurai are big on honor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You had to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.06,0:22:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Evidently not ready enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, easy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want your buddy Conjuro\Nto get hurt, you put that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The target is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearest Nami, dearest Robin, I hope\Nthe weather is nice where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.82,0:23:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.66,0:23:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.72,0:23:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can detect a sniper\Nfrom over a hundred feet away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing at all, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.48,0:23:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm trapped in a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, a hurricane called love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong! All wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to\Ndrink the tea, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.84,0:23:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You test for poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, once you're certain that it's safe,\Nyou give the tea to the Shogun, who is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.82,0:24:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not safe, then you\Nsimply die! Get it? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.44,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it again, Chopper! Amon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return shortly with your beverage!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun, I hope that my\Nlap is to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It is most satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I might stay\Nlike this all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.35,0:24:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to do so, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I might stay like this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.90,0:24:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean this wasn't a\Nsleeping-on-your-lap party?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you think, Brook? Play along. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a game, pretending\NMomo's the showgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.00,0:24:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we leave Momo alone, he gets all depressed\Nabout something and nobody knows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.64,0:25:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want to share it with us, but I\Nthink he went through something real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice myself,\Nbut I trust your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a funny fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.54,0:25:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to amuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.56,0:25:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I only take orders\Nfrom Captain Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.02,0:25:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know? Whoa, don't you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.30,0:25:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep a good corpse down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.26,0:25:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bury me deep, you won't hear a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.22,0:25:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon enough I'll\Nwake up from my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.84,0:25:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentality!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.08,0:25:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't got nothin' on me! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.76,0:26:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it. Uh-oh. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only people on\Nthis sunny, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.16,0:26:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a ghost? Creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.34,0:26:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorry me, this won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.40,0:26:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's coming from the men's dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.52,0:26:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it brought them back from the desk!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitors of Block B,\Nreport to the arena now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen Capman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo, it's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Block B is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.56,0:26:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a competitor called Capman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.92,0:26:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.34,0:27:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, sorry, pal.
